# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.5.0

# Snyk Code flagged 44 "hardcoded secret" findings, all inside tests/.
# Every one is an intentional fake fixture value (some deliberately
# shaped to also dodge GitHub's push-protection scanner) — never a real
# credential, never loaded outside a test process. The fix is not to
# change these values (that would defeat their purpose as realistic
# fixtures) but to stop Snyk Code from scanning test fixtures for
# "secrets" at all.
exclude:
  code:
    - tests/**
